<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Flat iron steak came with pommes frites and was covered with sauce béarnaise.  The meat was cooked a nice rare as requested and came pre-sliced.  It was tasty, tender and delightful with the sauce.  The fries were a small cut and cooked beautifully with a crisp exterior and creamy potato-filled interior.   They came with a container of ketchup and one of mayo for dipping.  They were fabulous.  As stated earlier, the plate came with a salad for which we substituted asparagus.  There was no charge for that.  They were almost smokier tasting than the meat.  They were tender and delicious too.  A really fine main plate.</p>
