<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Basque cake was topped with chantilly cream and sat on créme anglaise.  This was amazing.  A butter cake that was crispy on the exterior and had total soft richness on the inside.  This was delicious on steroids.  It didn&#8217;t really need the anglaise or the chantilly it was that good on its own.  It may have been the most delicious butter cake I&#8217;ve ever had.  It was so profound I couldn&#8217;t help but order a second one.  This was something hard to share.  Yum x5.</p>
